00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:24.780
Liquidity is never constant. During normal trading hours, the average bid-ask spread on liquid

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:30.300
Canadian and US equities might sit comfortably between four and eight basis points. But geopolitical

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:35.660
